@prefix : <https://example.org/test#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
:Person a owl:Class .
:Researcher a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf :Person .
:Professor a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf :Researcher .
:Alice a owl:NamedIndividual, :Professor .
